# Plan: FEATURES.md + finish-up maintenance

## Goal
Add a repo-root `FEATURES.md` listing major shipped TaskMesh capabilities as website-ready single-line bullets, and require finish-up to keep it current when major features ship.

## Scope
1. Create `FEATURES.md` (marketing one-liners; exclude Coming Soon placeholders such as Calendar/Filesystem).
2. Update finish-up in `development-rules.mdc` and `/worktask` skill: when a finished Task adds major user-facing functionality, update `FEATURES.md` in the same SemVer / `RELEASE_NOTES.md` commit.
3. Point to the file from `AGENTS.md` and `README.md`.

## Out of scope
- Rewriting `.cursor/plans/feature_list.md` (wishlist).
- Version bump until user says finish up.

## Done when
- `FEATURES.md` exists and reflects current shipped surface.
- Finish-up docs mention `FEATURES.md` alongside release notes.
